{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">綠城中國八月的合同銷售額，按年跌兩成九。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">按月升近三成九，至75億元人民幣。累計今年首八個月，合同銷售額726億元人民幣，按年跌兩成四。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T00:19:06.023185+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":68,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}